# The dependency-audit job's tool. It pins pip itself, which pip-audit reads through pip-api.
#
# pip-compile turns this into pip-audit.txt: every package, exact versions AND hashes, installed with
# `--require-hashes`. Dependabot keeps it current by re-running pip-compile on the Python its
# header names (3.11), so a bump never pins a set that cannot be installed together. Edit
# THIS file, then regenerate (run in python:3.11-slim):
#   pip-compile --allow-unsafe --generate-hashes --no-annotate --strip-extras \
#     --output-file=pip-audit.txt pip-audit.in
pip-audit
